{"seq":49,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:22:26.094Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ce680ee4003ed7cf2bba8559afad2f2ef2c601d749e2c7f695d7714a08eb4439","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis, on 14 Oct you told me Idris Brevik is your go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout, so he's who I'd call. (Soren Tolland, who you mentioned on 16 Oct, is at Tansleigh Packaging for Bittern, which is a different account.) I don't have a phone number for Idris on file. If today's problem isn't about Marlowe, tell me and I'll check what else I can find.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000133","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"}}
